     {
      "text": "The Apostasy Under the Man of Sin\n\nThis Psalm is in greater part the same as the fourteenth. It is the description of the apostasy, the complete turning away from God and opposition to God, which will hold sway when Satan’s mighty man is on the earth. Then the godly remnant will sigh for the coming of salvation out of Zion."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
